o enhancement if possible?","source_tag":"_t","target":"要添加词缀增强吗（如果可能的话）？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"76bd2ef4e8855fdff7ea23beb3996598aa9d88aa660cf7754e407fdae39ff89c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e1f89a6a6cd910973ec6b30fdab9c7b916dda7c23b3b18cf89f3d0e03e88b4b","logical_entry_identity":"18e3b1cf79154d1b500d3b7759920780a03da7a5bbd37c4a84520feb3c1970a6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Infusions, Runes, ...","source_tag":"_t","target":"纹身，符文，…"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"666b33d4ac5f0dff25f8dcecf4376e76783cc50f56a47994ce32da505981decc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e1f9e89d04b4c054409af2deb89bd9b18c9856e16da56b5c20673ea92d68871","logical_entry_identity":"8b2ff6f9ed9007a10443331efa95d20e82c054be79d47fbd832a8a32e05435a3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"forge-giant","source_tag":"entity name","target":"锻造巨人"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4d95be25a98f0cf2ff74aa814e2426bec0c59a21c9bdc6603253254508a35614","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e1fca98ee27001be70bbb43d384cd5c9f1416db5362dcfb211b46a369821a7d","logical_entry_identity":"424ce3fdf82a7b42314d38aa7d0abd3ec012312b6b124ba0274e297bab3e92cf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Corrupted Sand Wyrm","source_tag":"entity name","target":"堕落沙龙"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a0a21735b742a2a71a28ef6e89afd97be6cb4c2a096d5cbb6667476a049b5867","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e20778bdd8086ca490b31bc481a66fd1e9920a00d01bf74af11276a7bf8bbca","logical_entry_identity":"e7c2762154a1ed086c2400c90906359429314ea492064fa0ff07aa816daf3f3e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Exploration mode provides the characters using it with infinite lives.\nTales of Maj'Eyal is meant to be a very replayable game in which you get better by learning from mistakes (and thus from dying too).\nI realize this can not please everybody and after multiple requests I have decided to grant exploration mode to donators, because it will allow player that like the game to see it all if they wish.\nBeware though, infinite lives does not mean the difficulty is reduced, only that you can try as much as you want without restarting.\n\nIf you'd like to use this feature and find this game good you should consider donating. It will help ensure its survival.\nWhile this is a free game that I am doing for fun, if it can help feed my family a bit I certainly will not complain as real life can be harsh sometimes.\nYou will need an online profile active and connected for the tile selector to enable. If you choose to donate now you will need to restart the game to be granted access.\n\nDonators will also gain access to the custom tiles for their characters.","source_tag":"_t","target":"探索模式提供给角色无限的生命数。\n马基·埃亚尔的故事是一款非常耐玩的游戏，你需要不断的从错误中学习。（同样从死亡的错误中学习）\n我觉得这款游戏可能不会被所有人接受并且在接受了许多建议后，我决定开放探索模式给捐赠者，因为它允许喜欢这款游戏的玩家能全面地体验这款游戏。\n不过要注意的是，无限的生命并不意味着难度的减少，仅仅意味着你可以有着无限多的尝试次数。\n\n如果你喜欢这类游戏并且你觉得这款游戏很好，你可以考虑捐赠。\n这会帮助延长这款游戏的寿命。尽管这只是我自娱自乐所做的一款游戏，如果它还能帮助我分担一点养家糊口的压力的话，我就谢天谢地，不会再抱怨现实的诸多压力了。\n你需要一个已激活并保持连接的在线档案，贴图选择器才能启用。如果你现在选择捐赠，你需要重启游戏才能获得权限。\n\n捐赠者也可以使用自定义贴图来DIY他们的角色。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b27ea848e8af9f0f47f2c65f8be9029d39c2c1b2adc3e19532d2a1515812f2b0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e221434948ae5ec03da6a185b6a2722f1ce8e17a9ddf7d490e0149522646bb8","logical_entry_identity":"7e71a6853065e6bd40f54c7f1cc3e479846371ff7ba45b65c290fe0428fff2a5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This huge ritch seems to be the mother of all those here. Her sharp, fiery, claws dart toward you!","source_tag":"_t","target":"这只巨大的里奇似乎是所有里奇的母亲。她锋利而炽热的爪子向你扑来！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a5be0bb150123418da2392aacd672caa4ac77f2f49e29ebcde5fbc3bbc189e89","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e23816427ec1d6970c0925de87c051d27f988662d3b7c5727e4bcd2e01568fc","logical_entry_identity":"6a2ea39e10b3aa5aea91a01f8aeeb177e6ec237d4843c7ec69607edc2ef4d636","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Fade From Time","sourc