tinct. He does not seem surprised to see you.","source_tag":"_t","target":"乌尔罗格，水之主，是水中的恐怖恶魔。水在他周围蠕动，仿佛想要逃离，使他的身形模糊不清。他看到你似乎并不惊讶。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"104e11933a1947fd290329d054f1c8bf3ec4013fa6bcb2802dabdb346063e35b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5ed2cd499ba49351e37ec49af3e7631242929396f209e88343048b4d35ca7a13","logical_entry_identity":"5f251ed44df4310a8177335a48c6b478126c2dde3b179189a6502225d05ccd3a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD##{bold}#Always show glove combat properties#WHITE##{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD##{bold}#强制显示手套战斗数据#WHITE##{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"85fe08f2d7f4ab88e8cac26865e9721e6abc2c4307cb2f1dec1e82e57ef0e06b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5ed8e842a2d6aade033a0b54f8a301ee944bda089f7152439ef5eb1c1611c8b8","logical_entry_identity":"14fe931b849f8c700434ebc6397869b0a5d96f35a7730b36c89840e9d187d204","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"First talent level: ","source_tag":"_t","target":"第一级技能等级： "},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ac31d5c18b6beadc795ddd1c5cf92d0e0c0d611c3a0b75bcb53dff7093875eaf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5ed9fcd613ddc30dcdaa98ec1685d7860a551dfa4c8c96f15beaf73b2c271801","logical_entry_identity":"82e074b734c5c855e35fdabe815e0548b44ae84563a7be8b01854b758965dfd9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD##{bold}#Sharpen Visuals#WHITE##{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD##{bold}#锐化视觉#WHITE##{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4ca12b2642d83b458220bff97b93b6238f1f050e5014d1e35c3aadc786d4f47d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5eda1c87dc157c38702e3b0292649bc967473ca18fd9bc49166a6ca8da6cc37f","logical_entry_identity":"27bed37e5cf2aa448a38f863e94a06a0fe0b21f06136bd28be947bc6fd93ff88","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" of purity","source_tag":"entity name","target":"纯洁之"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"20d15867a2875e41418dbc1bf515366007df799221d68591abab6b1e86da1535","com